<title>HONG KONG: Citra Marga unit prices US$125 mln 144a bond.</title>
<headline>Citra Marga unit prices US$125 mln 144a bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue has been priced, said lead manager Peregrine Fixed Income.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITRA MARGA FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CITRA MARGA NUSAPHALA PERSADA</p>
<p> AMT   $125 MLN	SPREAD     130 BP    MATURITY    20.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE  BOND	    COUPON     7.25	PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY NONE     ISS PRICE  99.182    LAUNCH DATE 12.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB-     REOFFER    99.182    FULL FEES   NA</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	DENOMS (K) US$100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS STANDARD 144A</p>
<p> MGT/UND    NA	 SELL CONC  NA	   PAY FREQ    SEMI</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  INDONESIA</p>
<p> LEADS	PEREGRINE FIXED INCOME, DLJ, SBC WARBURG</p>
<p> NOTES	YIELDS 130 BP OVER FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
